@startuml DeferredRideReconstruction
actor Driver

... App has been observable on device during drive, buffering GPS samples ...

Driver -> App : Open application
App -> Backend : Check for active ride session
Backend -> App : No active session

App -> App : Inspect buffered GPS samples

alt Sufficient data to reconstruct
    App -> Driver : Prompt "Reconstruct deferred ride from buffered GPS?"

    alt Driver confirms
        Driver -> App : Confirm
        App -> Backend : Submit buffered GPS samples
        Backend -> Backend : Compute distance, duration, avg speed, earnings
        Backend -> Backend : Persist ride with status = DEFERRED
        Backend -> App : Ride created
        App -> Driver : Show updated home with new ride
    else Driver declines
        App -> App : Discard buffered samples
        App -> Driver : Return to home
    end

else Insufficient data
    App -> Driver : Return to home (no prompt, no ride created)
end

@enduml
